  "description": "Translate Umbraco content across cultures with AI. umContentTranslator walks your content tree, collects translatable values, batches them, and writes the AI translations back into the target languages — preserving Block Grid and Block List structure, rich text, Markdown, links, and other editor-specific data. Powered by Claude (Anthropic) or OpenAI, it also translates Umbraco dictionary items and adds a Content Translator section with a translation dialog and a Translation Logs dashboard. Includes a built-in free trial.",
